  "system": {
    "description": {
      "value": "<p><strong>Prerequisites:</strong> 4 ranks in any skill, skill leverage.</p>\n<p><strong>Benefit:</strong> Whenever you would use the change tactics skill leverage use to add 1d4 to the result of a roll, you may instead roll 1d6 and add the result to the roll. If such a check fails, the use of skill leverage is not expended, whereas if the check succeeds, there is a 50% chance that the use of skill leverage is not expended.</p>\n<p><a href=\"http://spheresofpower.wikidot.com/operative-feats#toc1\">Source: Spheres of Power Wiki</a></p>",
